$PrivacyPolicy_01_text_03 ="Your product or service choices and preferences. How we use your information. Communications with you - Offers and services in which you expressed interest: When you visit or conduct business transactions on our Site, you may be required to register with us or provide us with personal and account information. When you provide this information, we may use it to contact you about the offers or services in which you have expressed interest. Evo Global has a legitimate business interest in using the personal information we collect from you to provide such requested services. However, when we have relied on your consent, if you tell us that you do not want us to use this information as a basis for further contact with you (by accessing our opt-out procedure described below), we will respect your wishes. Communications with you - Newsletters and marketing purposes: To keep our users and customers informed about our latest news, products, and services, we may send emails and marketing communications to the email address you provided when registering on our Site or requesting information from us. Evo Global complies with applicable laws when using your personal information for this purpose, and where appropriate (such as in Mexico) relies on your consent. Please note that we sometimes partner with third parties to send marketing communications that promote third-party products and services (for example, those of our business partners) as well as our own. If you opted to subscribe to any of our email lists, newsletters, or other promotional offers and then decide you no longer wish to receive such newsletters or promotional emails from us, you may unsubscribe by following the instructions contained in each email we send you (or use the opt-out procedure described below). Professional interactions with you - Relationship management: We may use your relationship data (collected when you communicate with an Evo Global employee or agent by phone or email, for example) to provide you with the products or services you request and manage our relationship with you. We may also use certain de-identified and aggregated data about our IBOs and members or visitors to our Site for our internal data analysis purposes. Evo Global has a legitimate business interest in using the personal information we collect from you to provide such requested products and services and to better serve our IBOs and members. With your consent, we may send you information or services of a promotional nature that we believe may be relevant to you. Other uses: We may also use the personal information we obtain about you for the following purposes:";

