$PrivacyPolicy_02 ="Information provided to us about you by third parties.";
$PrivacyPolicy_02_text_01 ="Third-party content: We may display or embed content on our Site that is provided by our third-party vendors. This content may contain links to other sites not operated by Evo Global or may request personal information. For example, this content may ask for an email address to subscribe to alerts. This information is collected by our vendors and not by us. In some cases, these vendors may share the personal information they collect from you with us. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of our vendors. We encourage you to review their privacy policies to understand how they will use and share the personal information you provide to them. Third-party use: You may also separately share your information with other websites or entities, such as those that create professional marketing lists, to receive special offers and promotions from their affiliates. These websites or entities may share your information with us. Evo Global is not responsible and assumes no liability if a partner or other website or entity collects, uses, or shares any information about you in violation of its own privacy policy or applicable law. Third parties with whom we share your personal information. Third parties for retargeting advertising: In some cases, we will share information about how you use our Site with third-party vendors to show you more relevant advertising. For example, our vendors may track your browsing activity on our Site using cookies to show you ads based on your interests when you browse the Web or use social networks. Our vendors may also, in some cases, share information about your browsing activity on our Site with us for analytical purposes. Evo Global relies on your consent for such processing of your personal information. More information about these cookies, including how to provide or revoke your consent, can be found in our Cookie Policy below. Service providers: We may share your personal information with companies acting as