$PrivacyPolicy_02_text_02 ="Each service provider must commit to implementing and maintaining reasonable security procedures and practices appropriate to the nature of your information to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, destruction, use, modification, or disclosure. Because we operate globally, we may transfer your information to countries or jurisdictions that do not provide the same level of data protection as the country in which you are based. If we make such a transfer, we, or our vendors, as appropriate, will provide the safeguards required by applicable law to ensure that your information is protected. More information about international data transfers is provided below. When we share your personal information for our legitimate interests, you may object to this disclosure. Please note that when you object to the disclosure of your personal information for Evo Global’s legitimate interests, it may affect the products and services we provide you. More information about your rights is provided below.";

$PrivacyPolicy_03 ="Legally affiliated entities:";
